<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: 0, position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 26, width: 1168, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7' }}>检索：BM25 打分与近逐字证据</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 12, letterSpacing: 1.6, color: '#6B7C96' }}>RETRIEVAL / 12</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 96, width: 1168, height: 1, background: '#22314A' }} />

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 132, width: 640 }}>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, marginBottom: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.3, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 8 }}>OKAPI BM25　k1 = 1.5　b = 0.75</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 14, color: '#E6EDF7' }}>
        score = Σ IDF· tf(k1+1) / [tf + k1(1−b+b·|d|/avgdl)]
      </Text>
    </Box>
    {[
      ['IDF　逆文档频率', '一个词出现在越少的文档里，权重越大：查询里的 cucumber 比 plants 值钱。'],
      ['词频饱和 k1', '出现 3 次比 1 次分高，但 30 次不会无限涨——防止长文重复刷分。'],
      ['长度归一 b', '文档越长，同等词频得分被压低——短事实句和长故事可比。'],
    ].map(([t, d]) => (
      <Box key={t} style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, marginBottom: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7', marginBottom: 4 }}>{t}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 14, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>{d}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 724, top: 132, width: 500 }}>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, marginBottom: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.3, color: '#34D399', marginBottom: 8 }}>TOKENIZE / 5 STEPS</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D6E8', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>
        小写 → 按 [a-z0-9]+ 切词 → 去停用词 → 词形折叠（lilies→lily）→ 同义归并（bought→buy、birth→born、kids→child）
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18}}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.3, color: '#FBBF24', marginBottom: 8 }}>VERBATIM SOURCE TURN / v3.6</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D6E8', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
        触发：intent = lookup / unknown（覆盖 SS-A 56/56、SS-P 30/30）
        <br />
        动作：全证据层 BM25 取 top-1 轮次，<span style={{ color: '#E6EDF7', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>全文引用 1500 字符</span>
        <br />
        理由：答案逐字躺在轮次里；句子级摘录（260 字符）会丢掉细节。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, paddingTop: 10, borderTop: '1px solid #22314A' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 13, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          实测：SS-A 从 91.07 提升到 94.64（3-run mean），SS-P 同步 +3.33。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 664, width: 1168, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 12, color: '#6B7C96' }}>fusion v3.8 / v3.9.1</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 12, color: '#6B7C96' }}>12 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
